---
import Layout from '../../components/Layout.astro';import Comparison from '../../components/Comparison.astro';import Calculator from '../../components/Calculator.astro';import samples from '../../data/samples.json';const s=samples[0];const mb=s.rawBytes/1e6;
---
<Layout title="Canon EOS R6 Mark II RAW vs JPEG — sample & storage guide"><section class="hero wrap camera-hero"><p class="eyebrow">CAMERA FIELD NOTES / CANON</p><h1>EOS R6 Mark II.<br/><span>Which files should you keep?</span></h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>Start with a real full-frame RAW sample.<br/>Then calculate your own shooting year.</p><a class="primary-button" href="#storage">Calculate my storage ↓</a></div><div class="camera-stats"><div><strong>{mb.toFixed(2)} MB</strong><span>One measured RAW sample</span></div><div><strong>{Math.floor(128000/mb).toLocaleString('en-US')}</strong><span>Sample-sized RAW files / 128 GB</span></div><div><strong>{(mb*10000/1000).toFixed(1)} GB</strong><span>10,000 sample-sized RAW files</span></div></div></section><Comparison single/><section class="wrap prose compact"><h2>Use the sample as a starting point.</h2><p>This file uses {s.mode}. It does not represent every R6 Mark II scene or compression option. C-RAW, cropping, subject detail and camera settings can change file sizes. Enter a size from your own recent files for a more useful estimate.</p><h2>Questions before you choose</h2><details><summary>Is this a C-RAW file?</summary><p>No. The source labels this sample as “{s.mode}”. Do not apply its measured size to C-RAW or Dual Pixel RAW.</p></details><details><summary>Is the embedded preview my camera’s full-size JPEG?</summary><p>No. It is a preview inside this RAW file. A separately saved JPEG can have different dimensions, quality and file size.</p></details><details><summary>How many RAW photographs fit on a 128 GB card?</summary><p>At this sample’s measured {mb.toFixed(2)} MB size, approximately {Math.floor(128000/mb).toLocaleString('en-US')} files fit in decimal 128 GB, before formatting and other overhead. Actual capacity varies.</p></details></section><Calculator/></Layout>
